msgstr "PeakURL is opnieuw geïnstalleerd."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:221
msgid "The latest version has been reinstalled. Here's a look at what's included in this release."
msgstr "De nieuwste versie is opnieuw geïnstalleerd. Hier is een overzicht van wat er in deze release is opgenomen."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:232
msgid "Multi-tier object caching"
msgstr "Meervoudige objectcaching"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:233
msgid "Delivers sub-millisecond link redirects using Redis, APCu, or local filesystem storage with automatic backend fallback, configurable cache durations, and instant cache purging."
msgstr "Biedt razendsnelle linkomleidingen via Redis, APCu of lokale bestandssysteemopslag, inclusief automatische terugvalopties, instelbare bewaartermijnen en direct legen van de cache."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:239
msgid "Data safeguards"
msgstr "Gegevensbescherming"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:240
msgid "Trash protection and audit recovery"
msgstr "Prullenbakbeveiliging en herstel"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:241
msgid "Prevents accidental link loss with soft-delete safeguards, customizable retention schedules from 7 to 90 days, and one-click restoration directly from the activity history."
msgstr "Voorkomt onbedoeld linkverlies met bescherming tegen zacht verwijderen, aanpasbare bewaartermijnen van 7 tot 90 dagen en herstel met één klik rechtstreeks vanuit de activiteitengeschiedenis."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:248
msgid "Two-factor authentication and session controls"
msgstr "Tweeledige verificatie en sessiebeheer"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:249
msgid "Hardens administrator and editor accounts with TOTP two-factor authentication, single-use recovery backup codes, and real-time remote session revocation."
msgstr "Beveiligt beheer- en redactieaccounts met TOTP-tweestapsverificatie, eenmalige noodcodes en het op afstand beëindigen van actieve sessies in realtime."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:255
msgid "Access control"
msgstr "Toegangsbeheer"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:256
msgid "Public redirect bot and abuse defense"
msgstr "Bescherming tegen bots en misbruik bij omleidingen"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:257
msgid "Shields destination servers and infrastructure against crawler abuse using Cloudflare Turnstile and Google reCAPTCHA v3 without breaking social sharing previews."
msgstr "Beschermt doelservers en infrastructuur tegen geautomatiseerd misbruik via Cloudflare Turnstile en Google reCAPTCHA v3 zonder de weergave van sociale voorvertoningen te verstoren."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:263
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Privacy"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:264
msgid "On-premises location intelligence"
msgstr "Lokale locatieherkenning"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:265
msgid "Resolves visitor countries and cities locally on your server through an on-premises MaxMind GeoLite2 database, ensuring fast analytics without third-party tracking."
msgstr "Bepaalt landen en steden van bezoekers lokaal op uw eigen server met behulp van een MaxMind GeoLite2-database, voor snelle statistieken zonder externe trackers."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:272
msgid "Real-time traffic and engagement reporting"
msgstr "Realtime verkeers- en interactierapporten"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:273
msgid "Provides comprehensive click analytics covering total volume, unique visitors, referrers, device platforms, browser engines, and operating systems across custom date ranges."
msgstr "Biedt uitgebreide klikstatistieken over totaalvolume, unieke bezoekers, verwijzers, apparaattypen, browsers en besturingssystemen over gewenste periodes."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:279
msgid "Publishing"
msgstr "Publiceren"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:280
msgid "Branded short links and vector QR codes"
msgstr "Merkgebonden korte links en vector-QR-codes"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:281
msgid "Creates clean short links with custom aliases, generated codes, password protection, expiration schedules, social preview image overrides, and downloadable QR codes."
msgstr "Maakt overzichtelijke korte links met eigen aliassen, gegenereerde codes, wachtwoordbeveiliging, vervaldata, aangepaste sociale afbeeldingen en downloadbare QR-codes."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:287
msgid "Data mobility"
msgstr "Gegevensmobiliteit"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:288
msgid "Data import, export, and migration"
msgstr "Gegevens importeren, exporteren en migreren"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:289
msgid "Comprehensive data mobility supporting CSV and JSON file uploads, direct text pasting, API ingestion, full database exports, and native migration tools."
msgstr "Volledige gegevensvrijheid met ondersteuning voor CSV- en JSON-bestanden, direct plakken van tekst, API-invoer, complete database-exports en ingebouwde migratietools."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:295
#: client/pages/dashboard/links/components/StatsDrawer/TrafficSourcesTab.tsx:98
msgid "Developer"
msgstr "Ontwikkelaar"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:296
msgid "REST API and real-time webhooks"
msgstr "REST API en realtime webhooks"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:297
msgid "Automates publishing through token-authenticated REST endpoints, dispatches real-time webhooks on link events, and supports WordPress-style action and filter hooks."
msgstr "Automatiseert taken via beveiligde REST-eindpunten met tokens, activeert realtime webhooks bij linkgebeurtenissen en ondersteunt hooks in WordPress-stijl."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:303
msgid "Ecosystem"
msgstr "Ecosysteem"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:304
msgid "Official extensions and integrations"
msgstr "Officiële extensies en integraties"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:305
msgid "Shorten and manage links directly within your workflow using official add-ons for WordPress, Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, Docker, and the command-line CLI."
msgstr "Kort en beheer links rechtstreeks vanuit uw workflow met officiële extensies voor WordPress, Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, Docker en de opdrachtregel (CLI)."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:311
msgid "Operations"
msgstr "Beheer"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:312
msgid "Live Site Health diagnostics"
msgstr "Realtime statusdiagnose van de site"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:313
msgid "Continuously monitors database connectivity, PHP runtime settings, disk storage, cache engine status, and GeoLite2 file integrity with precision localized timestamps."
msgstr "Controleert voortdurend databaseverbindingen, PHP-instellingen, schijfruimte, cachestatus en GeoLite2-bestandsintegriteit met nauwkeurige tijdsaanduidingen."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:319
msgid "Localization"
msgstr "Lokalisatie"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:320
msgid "26 global language packs with native RTL"
msgstr "26 internationale taalpakketten met native RTL-ondersteuning"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:321
msgid "Offers full native translations across 26 international languages and regional variants, with complete right-to-left layout and typography orchestration out of the box."
msgstr "Biedt volledige vertalingen in 26 talen en regionale varianten, inclusief directe ondersteuning voor van rechts naar links geschreven talen (RTL)."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:346
msgid "Use"
msgstr "Gebruik"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:347
msgid "Run PeakURL for any purpose, personal projects, business, education, or anything in between."
msgstr "Gebruik PeakURL voor elk doel: persoonlijke projecten, zakelijk, onderwijs of alles daartussenin."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:353
msgid "Study"
msgstr "Bestuderen"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:354
msgid "Explore the source code, understand how it works, and modify it to suit your exact needs."
msgstr "Verken de broncode, begrijp hoe het werkt en pas het aan uw behoeften aan."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:360
#: client/pages/dashboard/links/components/StatsDrawer/StatsDrawer.tsx:182
msgid "Share"
msgstr "Delen"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:361
msgid "Redistribute copies freely so others can benefit from the same powerful link management platform."
msgstr "Verspreid kopieën vrij zodat anderen kunnen profiteren van een open, privacyvriendelijke URL-verkorter."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:367
msgid "Improve"
msgstr "Verbeteren"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:368
msgid "Enhance PeakURL and share your improvements, contributing back to the open-source community."
msgstr "Verbeter PeakURL en deel uw optimalisaties, bugfixes of nieuwe functies met de community."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:457
msgid "Languages"
msgstr "Talen"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:465
msgid "Global locales & native RTL"
msgstr "Wereldwijde talen & native RTL"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:472
msgid "Subsystems"
msgstr "Deelsystemen"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:480
msgid "Core modular capabilities"
msgstr "Modulaire kernfuncties"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:495
msgid "Full data sovereignty"
msgstr "Volledige datasoevereiniteit"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:502
msgid "Open Source"
msgstr "Open Source"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:510
msgid "Inspectable and free forever"
msgstr "Transparant en voor altijd vrij"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:516
msgid "Everything you need to publish short links, measure engagement, protect your data, and operate the service with complete control."
msgstr "Alles wat u nodig heeft om korte links te publiceren, interactie te meten, gegevens te beveiligen en de dienst in eigen beheer te gebruiken."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:520
#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:646
msgid "What's Inside"
msgstr "Inhoud van het pakket"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:534
msgid "PeakURL is built to stay understandable in day-to-day use, dependable under load, and open for long-term ownership."
msgstr "PeakURL is ontworpen om helder te blijven in dagelijks gebruik, betrouwbaar onder belasting en transparant voor langdurig eigenaarschap."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:538
msgid "Product Principles"
msgstr "Productprincipes"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:547
msgid "Clear By Default"
msgstr "Helder als standaard"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:550
msgid "The dashboard stays direct and readable so routine operations like publishing links, reviewing traffic, and managing users remain effortless."
msgstr "Het dashboard blijft overzichtelijk zodat dagelijkse handelingen zoals het aanmaken van links, verkeer bekijken en gebruikersbeheer soepel verlopen."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:560
msgid "Portable To Run"
msgstr "Eenvoudig te draaien"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:563
msgid "The application installs cleanly on standard PHP and MySQL hosting with native PDO prepared statements and zero external control plane dependencies."
msgstr "De applicatie installeert probleemloos op standaard PHP- en MySQL-omgevingen met native PDO prepared statements en zonder externe afhankelijkheden."

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:573
msgid "Open And Inspectable"
msgstr "Open en inspecteerbaar"

#: client/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:576
msgid "The entire codebase is auditable, free of telemetry, and extensible via WordPress-style hooks so operators always maintain full data custody."
msgstr "De volledige broncode is controleerbaar, vrij van telemetrie en uitbreidbaar via hooks, waardoor beheerders te allen tijde volledige controle houden over hun data."

